37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that last year, two of us went from breakfast to dinner without meeting. A group that moves together shares the day","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I found that last year, two of us went from breakfast to dinner without meeting. A group that moves together shares the day""}]}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The train to the spa valley takes ninety minutes. The city has trains every few minutes, so no planning needed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The train to the spa valley takes ninety minutes. The city has trains every few minutes, so no planning needed.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Dinner is at six, breakfast at half seven. Everyone sleeps on futons in one room.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Daisuke"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Daisuke: Dinner is at six, breakfast at half seven. Everyone sleeps on futons in one room.""}]}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Midori, that finding worries me. If we drift apart, the shared experience breaks. I need to know if the costs prevent that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, I agree. The isolation was the problem. I want to understand if a shared house or a town prevents that drift.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: @Victoria, I agree. The isolation was the problem. I want to understand if a shared house or a town prevents that drift.""}]}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Toshio, ninety minutes is manageable. I am more concerned about the city’s hourly bus stopping before seven.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the fixed meal times are a bit strict, but I’m glad to know the schedule.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Midori, knowing we drifted apart is useful, but I still need the total cost. Can we agree on a budget cap before we choose?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, a cap is wise, but I worry it might force us into a place that feels crowded or empty. I want the right fit first.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, a cap is reasonable, but I need to know if the travel time fits within it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I understand the need for certainty. I just hope the fixed schedule doesn’t make me feel trapped in the room.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m still waiting on my ferry and bus results! I hope they show we can move around easily without losing whole days.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am confirming my findings: offshore houses cost about 5,400 yen per head per night, plus food. Last year’s separate rooms varied by nearly 8,000 yen.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am confirming my findings: last year we drifted apart, and a town with streets and a public bath absorbs the need for time alone easily.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I am confirming my findings: last year we drifted apart, and a town with streets and a public bath absorbs the need for time alone easily.""}]}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am confirming my findings: the city runs on trains every few minutes, but the spa valley bus stops before seven in the evening.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am confirming my findings: dinner at six, breakfast at half seven, and everyone shares one room on futons.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
