60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found the ferry takes two days total, but city trains are super fast! Which option sounds best to you all?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The island house is 5,400 yen per head per night, plus food. Last year’s separate rooms varied by nearly 8,000 yen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,Last year we drifted apart. A town with streets and a public bath absorbs the need for time alone easily.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: Last year we drifted apart. A town with streets and a public bath absorbs the need for time alone easily.""}]}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry eats two days, which is unacceptable. The ninety-minute train to the spa valley is far more efficient for our schedule.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,The fixed meal times and shared room worry me. I need to know if I can sleep well there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the ferry’s two-day loss is a hard constraint. I need to know if the island’s single bill covers that travel cost fairly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the island bill is one sum, but the time cost is not. I cannot accept losing two days to travel.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I hear you. But the city’s separate rooms mean I might not see anyone all day, which feels lonely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I agree the time loss is severe. But the island’s single bill divides evenly, unlike last year’s uneven separate rooms.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, the even bill is appealing, but the island’s single bathroom and cold water reviews worry me. I need comfort for my sleep.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, the island’s single bathroom is a genuine flaw. The spa town’s baths open until midnight, which solves that without the travel penalty.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the midnight baths help, but the six o’clock dinner and shared futons still feel too rigid for my sleep.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"I’m leaning toward the city! It’s fast, and I can pick my own spots. Does anyone else want to vote for the city break?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I support the city. The separate rooms mean I can see exactly what I pay, avoiding the hidden costs of a shared house.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I choose the hot spring town. The baths and streets give us space to be together without crowding each other.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I choose the hot spring town. The baths and streets give us space to be together without crowding each other.""}]}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I vote for the hot spring town. The ninety-minute train preserves our week, and the baths solve the comfort issues.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the city break. Having my own room with a door means I can sleep without a strict timetable.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
